</JSONUIProvider>;Features Streaming (SpecStream) Stream AI responses progressively: 逐步流式传输 AI 响应 import { createSpecStreamCompiler } from "@json-render/core"; const compiler = createSpecStreamCompiler<MySpec>(); // Process chunks as they arrive
const { result, newPatches } = compiler.push(chunk);
setSpec(result); // Update UI with partial result // Get final result
const finalSpec = compiler.getResult();从你的目录中生成系统提示 const systemPrompt = catalog.prompt();
// Includes component descriptions, props schemas, available actions Conditional Visibility { "type": "Alert", "props": { "message": "Error occurred" }, "visible": [ { "$state": "/form/hasError" }, { "$state": "/form/errorDismissed", "not": true } ]
} Dynamic Props 任何属性值都可以通过表达式实现数据驱动： { "type": "Icon", "props": { "name": { "$cond": { "$state": "/activeTab", "eq": "home" }, "$then": "home", "$else": "home-outline" }, "color": { "$cond": { "$state": "/activeTab", "eq": "home" }, "$then": "#007AFF", "$else": "#8E8E93" } }
} Expression forms:{ "$state": "/state/key" } - reads a value from the state model { "$state": "/state/key" } - 从状态模型中读取一个值 { "$cond": <condition>, "$then": <value>, "$else": <value> } - 评估一个条件并选择一个分支 { "$template": "Hello, ${/user/name}!" } - interpolates state values into strings { "$template": "Hello, ${/user/name}!" } - 将状态值插值到字符串中 { "$computed": "fn", "args": { ... } } - calls a registered function with resolved args { "$computed": "fn", "args": { ... } } - 调用已注册的函数并使用已解析的参数 Actions 组件可以触发操作，包括内置的 setState 操作： { "type": "Pressable", "props": { "action": "setState", "actionParams": { "statePath": "/activeTab", "value": "home" } }, "children": ["home-icon"]
} The setState action updates the state model directly, which re-evaluates visibility conditions and dynamic prop expressions.State Watchers 响应状态变化通过触发操作： { "type": "Select", "props": { "value": { "$bindState": "/form/country" }, "options": ["US", "Canada", "UK"] }, "watch": { "/form/country": { "action": "loadCities", "params": { "country": { "$state": "/form/country" } } } }
} watch is a top-level field on elements (sibling of type / props / children). Watchers fire when the watched value changes, not on initial render. watch 是元素上的顶级字段（与 type / props / children 同级）。监听器在被监听的值发生变化时触发，而非在初始渲染时。 Demo git clone https://github.com/vercel-labs/json-render
